<p>&#8220;Absolutely not,&#8221; the governor said Monday at the White House, where he was participating in the National Governors Association annual meeting. &#8220;Why? I mean, we won.&#8221;</p>
<p>The Virginia Senate has approved a resolution urging Minnesota to return the flag, which was captured by the Minnesota 1st Volunteer Regiment at the Battle of Gettysburg in 1863. The Virginia House is expected to vote on the resolution soon.</p>
<p>The Minnesota Historical Society has refused previous requests to return the flag, and its administrators say they have no intention of returning it. That could change if the Minnesota state government, which funds 65 percent of the society&#8217;s budget, gets involved, but that doesn&#8217;t seem likely.</p><div class="s2nPlayer k-wQoDAMss" data-type="float" data-s2n-api="dfm_stn_player_script_id_wQoDAMss"></div><script>	function dfm_stn_player_script_id_wQoDAMss( getS2NApiForPlayer ) {
